            %li#Voevodsky00
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vladimir+Voevodsky"}> Vladimir Voevodsky
                , section 3.1 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Triangulated categories of motives over a field
